<https://w3id.org/mado#CTX-DEMO-MOB-RUIDO> <https://w3id.org/mado#temParticipacao> <https://w3id.org/mado#PART-CTX-DEMO-MOB-RUIDO-PESSOA> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#CTX-DEMO-MOB-RUIDO> <https://w3id.org/mado#temRecursoDisponivel> <https://w3id.org/mado#REC-SAIDA-AUDIO> .
