<https://w3id.org/mado#CTX-DEMO-MOB-RUIDO> <https://w3id.org/mado#temRecursoDisponivel> <https://w3id.org/mado#REC-VIBRACAO> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#CTX-DEMO-MOB-RUIDO> <https://w3id.org/mado#temRecursoProposto> <https://w3id.org/mado#REC-FEEDBACK-ACESSIVEL> .
